    "fullSolution": "AB: [[1,2],[3,4]]·[[0,1],[1,0]] = [[2,1],[4,3]]. BA: [[0,1],[1,0]]·[[1,2],[3,4]] = [[3,4],[1,2]]. Since AB ≠ BA, matrix multiplication is not commutative.",
